:"NONE","body":"Thanks. I just run the UT and found this weird behavior on intel platform. I'm fine if `jax.clear_backends()` is deprecated.  I didn't see similar issues on `jax.clear_caches()` .","created_at":"2024-03-13T06:22:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022#issuecomment-1993652896","id":1993652896,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc521Lqg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1993652896/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-03-13T06:22:43Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1993652896","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79236274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jianyizh","id":79236274,"login":"jianyizh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjM2Mjc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135203619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yueshengys","id":135203619,"login":"yueshengys","node_id":"U_kgDOCA8LIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135203619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yueshengys","id":135203619,"login":"yueshengys","node_id":"U_kgDOCA8LIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yueshengys","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\r\n\r\njax.clear_backends() does not release device memory allocated by BFC allocator. For example, running jax ut ```TF_CPP_MIN_LOG_LEVEL=0 python tests/clear_backends_test.py``` on A100 40G, you can see infos like ```I external/xla/xla/stream_executor/cuda/cuda_driver.cc:1571] failed to allocate 29.67GiB (31861358592 bytes) from device: CUDA_ERROR_OUT_OF_MEMORY: out of memory``` after ```Clearing JAX backend caches```. The reason is that xla first allocate 0.75*40G in BFC at the first call of ```g```, then after ```clear_backends()``` and call ```g``` again, it will try to Extend the BFC Allocator by 9G instead of release or use the previous 29G.\r\n\r\nHere's a test case that can pass without ```clear_backends()``` but OOM with it.\r\n```python\r\nfrom absl.testing import absltest\r\n\r\nimport jax\r\nfrom jax import config\r\nfrom jax._src import test_util as jtu\r\nfrom jax._src import xla_bridge as xb\r\n\r\nconfig.parse_flags_with_absl()\r\n\r\n\r\nclass ClearBackendsTest(jtu.JaxTestCase):\r\n\r\n  def test_clear_backends(self):\r\n    g = jax.jit(lambda x: x+1.)\r\n    a = jax.numpy.zeros((1024,1024,512,4),dtype=jax.numpy.float32)\r\n    a = g(a)\r\n    print(a)\r\n    jax.clear_backends() #skip this line to pass\r\n    b = jax.numpy.ones((1024,1024,512,4),dtype=jax.numpy.float32)\r\n    b = g(b)\r\n    print(b)\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n  absltest.main(testLoader=jtu.JaxTestLoader())\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\r\n\r\nI'm running jax compiled from main on A100 40G.\r\n\r\njax:    0.4.26.dev20240229+58f898b36\r\njaxlib: 0.4.26.dev20240229\r\nnumpy:  1.26.4\r\npython: 3.10.13 (main, Sep 11 2023, 13:44:35) [GCC 11.2.0]\r\njax.devices (1 total, 1 local): [cuda(id=0)]\r\nprocess_count: 1\r\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='milan-01', release='5.4.0-169-generic', version='#187-Ubuntu SMP Thu Nov 23 14:52:28 UTC 2023', machine='x86_64')\r\n","closed_at":"2024-03-13T06:22:43Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79236274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jianyizh","id":79236274,"login":"jianyizh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjM2Mjc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jianyizh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022/comments","created_at":"2024-02-29T08:49:55Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022","id":2160729764,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc6Ayh6k","number":20022,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":"completed","sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20022/timeline","title":"jax.clear_